  "setup": "Two disposable KOTOR 1 GOG directories, 800x600 each, private non-input Windows desktops, native GL_FRONT screenshot harness. Published release binaries, existing Dantooine host save, empty joiner saves and first-time Soldier creation. No desktop or audio capture.",
  "controls": "Menu, portrait, movement and inventory actions use native harness input. Connect, chat (say), disconnect and reconnect use the existing agent console channel; these clips do not demonstrate typing with Enter or selecting an internet server.",
  "editing": "Native images scaled with Lanczos, editorial title bars added above the game view, no game pixels replaced. Cuts explicitly labeled. GIFs derive from the accompanying public MP4s with the per-clip manifest filter. Screenshot samples repeat between observations; exported 10 FPS is not game performance.",
  "recordingCaveat": "The screenshot and save harness share a command channel. The first leave/rejoin recording was excluded after a save timeout. The retained recording pauses capture commands for three seconds around disconnect/reconnect and cuts those waits. Agent logs confirm the dedicated disconnect save completed in 1325 ms before reconnect.",
  "scope": "Staged local demonstration of these selected features, not a complete campaign, independent-PC internet test, inventory persistence audit or game-restart recovery test. The host has existing gear; the new joiner starts with an empty backpack. No combat in these new clips.",
